      ],
      "source": "https://newport-wa.org/about/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The local museum showcases three relocated log cabins, a replica logging camp bunkhouse, and a Burlington Northern caboose.",
